70_2599724200512993_4186710068073071308_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O478D3pbuZYQ7kNvwENj0iX&_nc_oc=AdoNxjQ8Tynf97EHeY77rsVq-GML2XZ_RUugIffauXehXunlMmnmjXTyjviJcc6lkLU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVfxMN6FD_op9Ut3l3puLX2Nf2XoaN3a1wH2pMXQU9UoQ&oe=6B104DDC"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1970810014297799", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604293968_1970810017631132_5072967999980726657_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wLfxmjkC-fwQ7kNvwFf9wN6&_nc_oc=AdrDONzpf7XezETkqmP-IshGel0L-fjU84CQlFfZM0zS1XQK1twNxWgwwCY1NpMAwm4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVS1HSAX3H8G7m1Gon4hI_pdiqmyEDzU46uJ6HABZ4uHg&oe=6B10374C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Plank Walk : Fear of Heights", "keywords": ["plank", "walk", "walkplank", "plankheight", "plankGlider"], "long_description": "Will you walk to the end or hesitate at the edge? Plank Walk: Height of Fear combines VR plank walk challenges, zipline action and a puppy rescue at sea across two modes.\n\nWALK THE PLANK\nStep onto a wooden plank, look ahead and begin your walk above the drop. Every step puts the height in view. Keep your nerve as you discover how a simple plank can feel very different in virtual reality.\n\nTRY THE INVISIBLE PLANK\nReady for a different plank walk? Walk along an invisible plank with no visible board beneath you. The route may be hidden, but the suspense is right in front of you. Switch from plank walking to a zipline ride for another way to experience virtual heights.\n\nMEET THE FRIGHTENED CHARACTERS\nYou are not alone in fearing the plank! Meet different characters, grab and throw them, and discover their reactions. Experiment with character interactions as you play around the plank.\n\nRESCUE THE PUPPY\nTake a break from the plank walk and enter the sea rescue mode. A puppy needs saving while a shark attacks. Focus on the rescue and try to bring the puppy to safety.\n\nFEATURES\n\u2022 Two modes: plank activities and puppy rescue\n\u2022 VR plank walk challenges\n\u2022 Wooden plank and invisible plank activities\n\u2022 Zipline rides at height\n\u2022 Characters to grab, throw and interact with\n\u2022 Sea rescue with an attacking shark\n\nWalk into the challenge. Face the drop. Make your next plank walk count!", "short_description": "Walk the plank and test your nerve in Plank Walk: Height of Fear! Explore a VR plank walk challenge with wooden planks, invisible planks and zipline action, or rescue a puppy at sea while a shark attacks. Walk above the drop, meet characters frightened of the plank, and grab and throw them to explore their reactions. From your first plank walk to a tense puppy rescue, can you keep your cool?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rebelsgamestudio/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rebels Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rebelsgamestudio", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1380770837540526"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_1807389220442740_69049194356